# Hand-derived expected index frame F-M9 (plan 08-03, D-02, D-03, D-05): ivs-diag-stic-2, in-process only: tall mode at Y size code 0 (half height), even-line default.
# Derivation: docs/video/diag-stic-2-derivation.md section (e), written before the program, the renderer or any run; never produced by a run: pinned sampling frame: one tall MOB at 1x from two cards.
# Plane grammar: 96 rows after the line plane, each 20 groups of 8 symbols (0-9A-F, and - inside a declared unknown rectangle) separated by one space; the 8th symbol of group 20
# is the cut-off pixel of the 7-pixel last column (clip side right) and is written -. The published plane is the 159 columns left of it.
